    "category": "Non-automatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["PW 134"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "PW 134 is a portable weighing instrument designed for determining the weight of wheels, axles, and the total weight (gross vehicle weight) of road vehicles. The weighing instrument operates in non-automatic mode with a single weighing range. It consists of weighing platforms (load receptors with integrated strain gauge load cells), levelling pads, and an indication unit with legally relevant software (WSERVER, WTERMINAL, Firmware PSU). Platforms communicate with the indication unit via RS-485 cable or Bluetooth; the indication unit communicates with external clients via Ethernet or Wi-Fi."
